      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/32/eng@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 23 of the principal Act is amended—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/32/eng@/~cl_10__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/32/eng@/~cl_10",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in subsection (2), by substituting for the words “fifty- eight” the word “sixty”; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/32/eng@/~cl_10__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/32/eng@/~cl_10",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for subsection (2a) the following subsection: “ (2a) Where an officer referred to in subsection (2) who was reappointed before 1 January 2012 had been given an option before such date and had not opted for the compulsory age of retirement of sixty years, subsection (2) shall apply to him with the words ‘fifty- five’ or ‘fifty-six’ or ‘fifty-eight’, as the case may be, being substituted for the word ‘sixty’.”. Amendment of section 25"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/32/eng@/~cl_11",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "11",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/32/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 25 of the principal Act is amended in paragraph (b) by substituting for the words “twelve and a half years”, wherever they appear, the words “twenty years”. Savings and transitional"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/32/eng@/~cl_12",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
